  "prediction_postprocess": "adsb-surface-residual-v18-v1",
  "prior_evidence": "Declared after adsb_v17 (docs/adsb_v17/README.md): four combination CatBoosts and the one-third / two-thirds bag moved the development mean ratio to v15 to 0.99725 and the export scored 241.75 officially (v15 242.5783). Learner-level RMSE on the non-LIRF rows (seasonal / forward): the combination group of five 267.74 / 158.45, ens_v17_bag_ctr_c2 267.35 / 157.33; a descriptive scan of the LightGBM share a on the recorded tables gives 267.26 / 157.46 at a = 0.2, 267.26 / 157.36 at 0.25, 267.35 / 157.33 at 1/3 and 267.74 / 158.45 at 0 (no LightGBM), so the share is near its optimum and the remaining lever is more combination members: each of v17's plain seeds was worth roughly 0.1 percentage points of the mean ratio. The four learners here are two more seeds of the cat_ctr2 recipe and two more of cat_ctr3 (the depth-10 and one-hot variants of v17 were not better than a plain seed and are not repeated). No learner listed here had been fitted before this declaration.",
